    challengesLabel: THE CHALLENGES
    challenge: <p data-end="577" data-start="310"><strong data-end="333" data-start="310">Multichannel orders</strong><br data-end="336" data-start="333"/>Your customers place orders by phone, through your field sales representatives, or directly via your online platform. Without a centralized system, orders get lost or duplicated, and your team spends time re-entering data instead of selling.</p><p data-end="779" data-start="579"><strong data-end="602" data-start="579">Complex price lists</strong><br data-end="605" data-start="602"/>Each professional customer has their own pricing conditions — negotiated discounts, special prices, currencies. Managing them manually creates errors and commercial friction.</p><p data-end="972" data-start="781"><strong data-end="817" data-start="781">Stock management &amp; replenishment</strong><br data-end="820" data-start="817"/>With high volumes and multiple suppliers, anticipating stockouts without a centralized tool is costly in terms of lost sales and
      dissatisfied customers.</p><p data-end="1147" data-start="974"><strong data-end="1008" data-start="974">After-sales service management</strong><br data-end="1011" data-start="1008"/>Tracking returns, complaints, and exchanges from professional customers while keeping a clear view of order history is a daily headache.</p><p data-end="1361" data-start="1149"><strong data-end="1171" data-start="1149">Sales KPI tracking</strong><br data-end="1174" data-start="1171"/>Without a centralized dashboard, it is impossible to know which customers, products, or sales representatives are truly performing. Decisions are made based on intuition rather than data.</p>
